{"seq":4,"slug":"event-loop","title":"事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/event-loop","wordCount":826,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件循环\">事件循环</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件循环是单线程 JavaScript 实现异步的核心机制，协调<strong>调用栈、宏任务队列与微任务队列</strong>。每轮循环取一个宏任务执行，随后<strong>清空全部微任务</strong>，再视需要执行 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 回调并完成渲染，最后在空闲时运行 <code>requestIdleCallback</code>。微任务（Promise）始终优先于宏任务（<code>setTimeout</code>）执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"javascript-的并发模型\">JavaScript 的并发模型</h2><p>JavaScript 是<strong>单线程</strong>语言，同一时间只能执行一个任务。事件循环（Event Loop）是浏览器实现异步编程的核心机制，它协调调用栈、任务队列和微任务队列，使 JS 能够处理异步操作而不阻塞主线程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CallStack[&quot;调用栈\\nCall Stack&quot;]&#10;    WebAPIs[&quot;Web APIs\\n(setTimeout, fetch, DOM events)&quot;]&#10;    TaskQueue[&quot;宏任务队列\\nTask Queue&quot;]&#10;    MicrotaskQueue[&quot;微任务队列\\nMicrotask Queue&quot;]&#10;&#10;    CallStack --&gt;|调用异步 API| WebAPIs&#10;    WebAPIs --&gt;|回调就绪| TaskQueue&#10;    CallStack --&gt;|Promise.then / queueMicrotask| MicrotaskQueue&#10;&#10;    MicrotaskQueue --&gt;|&quot;栈空 → 先清空微任务&quot;| CallStack&#10;    TaskQueue --&gt;|&quot;微任务清空 → 取一个宏任务&quot;| CallStack\">flowchart TD\n    CallStack[\"调用栈\\nCall Stack\"]\n    WebAPIs[\"Web APIs\\n(setTimeout, fetch, DOM events)\"]\n    TaskQueue[\"宏任务队列\\nTask Queue\"]\n    MicrotaskQueue[\"微任务队列\\nMicrotask Queue\"]\n\n    CallStack --&gt;|调用异步 API| WebAPIs\n    WebAPIs --&gt;|回调就绪| TaskQueue\n    CallStack --&gt;|Promise.then / queueMicrotask| MicrotaskQueue\n\n    MicrotaskQueue --&gt;|\"栈空 → 先清空微任务\"| CallStack\n    TaskQueue --&gt;|\"微任务清空 → 取一个宏任务\"| CallStack</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调用栈-call-stack\">调用栈（Call Stack）</h2><p>调用栈是一个 LIFO（后进先出）数据结构，跟踪当前正在执行的函数。每次函数调用会压入一个栈帧，函数返回时弹出。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function multiply(a: number, b: number): number {&#10;  return a * b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function square(n: number): number {&#10;  return multiply(n, n);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function printSquare(n: number): void {&#10;  const result = square(n);&#10;  console.log(result);&#10;}&#10;&#10;printSquare(4);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n, n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printSquare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> square</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">printSquare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Step1[&quot;步骤 1&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;printSquare&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Step2[&quot;步骤 2&quot;]&#10;        S2a[&quot;square&quot;]&#10;        S2b[&quot;printSquare&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Step3[&quot;步骤 3&quot;]&#10;        S3a[&quot;multiply&quot;]&#10;        S3b[&quot;square&quot;]&#10;        S3c[&quot;printSquare&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Step4[&quot;步骤 4&quot;]&#10;        S4a[&quot;square&quot;]&#10;        S4b[&quot;printSquare&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Step5[&quot;步骤 5&quot;]&#10;        S5[&quot;printSquare&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Step1 --&gt; Step2 --&gt; Step3 --&gt; Step4 --&gt; Step5\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Step1[\"步骤 1\"]\n        S1[\"printSquare\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Step2[\"步骤 2\"]\n        S2a[\"square\"]\n        S2b[\"printSquare\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Step3[\"步骤 3\"]\n        S3a[\"multiply\"]\n        S3b[\"square\"]\n        S3c[\"printSquare\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Step4[\"步骤 4\"]\n        S4a[\"square\"]\n        S4b[\"printSquare\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Step5[\"步骤 5\"]\n        S5[\"printSquare\"]\n    end\n    Step1 --&gt; Step2 --&gt; Step3 --&gt; Step4 --&gt; Step5</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"宏任务与微任务\">宏任务与微任务</h2><p>浏览器中的异步任务分为<strong>宏任务（Macrotask / Task）</strong> 和<strong>微任务（Microtask）</strong> 两类，它们的执行时机不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宏任务</td>\n<td><code>setTimeout</code>, <code>setInterval</code>, <code>MessageChannel</code>, I/O, UI rendering</td>\n<td>每轮事件循环取一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微任务</td>\n<td><code>Promise.then/catch/finally</code>, <code>queueMicrotask</code>, <code>MutationObserver</code></td>\n<td>当前宏任务结束后全部清空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"console.log(&#39;1: script start&#39;);&#10;&#10;setTimeout(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;2: setTimeout&#39;);&#10;}, 0);&#10;&#10;Promise.resolve()&#10;  .then(() =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;3: promise 1&#39;);&#10;  })&#10;  .then(() =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;4: promise 2&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;queueMicrotask(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;5: queueMicrotask&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;console.log(&#39;6: script end&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1: script start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2: setTimeout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3: promise 1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4: promise 2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">queueMicrotask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5: queueMicrotask'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'6: script end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出顺序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1: script start&#10;6: script end&#10;3: promise 1&#10;5: queueMicrotask&#10;4: promise 2&#10;2: setTimeout\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1: script start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>6: script end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3: promise 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5: queueMicrotask</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4: promise 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2: setTimeout</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"事件循环的完整流程\">事件循环的完整流程</h2><p>每一轮事件循环按以下顺序执行：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Start[&quot;开始一轮事件循环&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt; Task[&quot;1. 从宏任务队列取一个任务执行&quot;]&#10;    Task --&gt; Microtasks[&quot;2. 清空所有微任务&quot;]&#10;    Microtasks --&gt; NeedRender{&quot;3. 是否需要渲染?&quot;}&#10;    NeedRender -- 是 --&gt; RAF[&quot;3a. 执行 requestAnimationFrame 回调&quot;]&#10;    RAF --&gt; Style[&quot;3b. Style 计算&quot;]&#10;    Style --&gt; Layout[&quot;3c. Layout 布局&quot;]&#10;    Layout --&gt; Paint[&quot;3d. Paint 绘制&quot;]&#10;    Paint --&gt; Composite[&quot;3e. Composite 合成&quot;]&#10;    Composite --&gt; Idle[&quot;4. 空闲时间 → requestIdleCallback&quot;]&#10;    NeedRender -- 否 --&gt; Idle&#10;    Idle --&gt; Start\">flowchart TD\n    Start[\"开始一轮事件循环\"]\n    Start --&gt; Task[\"1. 从宏任务队列取一个任务执行\"]\n    Task --&gt; Microtasks[\"2. 清空所有微任务\"]\n    Microtasks --&gt; NeedRender{\"3. 是否需要渲染?\"}\n    NeedRender -- 是 --&gt; RAF[\"3a. 执行 requestAnimationFrame 回调\"]\n    RAF --&gt; Style[\"3b. Style 计算\"]\n    Style --&gt; Layout[\"3c. Layout 布局\"]\n    Layout --&gt; Paint[\"3d. Paint 绘制\"]\n    Paint --&gt; Composite[\"3e. Composite 合成\"]\n    Composite --&gt; Idle[\"4. 空闲时间 → requestIdleCallback\"]\n    NeedRender -- 否 --&gt; Idle\n    Idle --&gt; Start</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 浏览器通常以 60fps 刷新，即每 16.67ms 一帧。如果一轮事件循环中宏任务+微任务执行超过 16.67ms，就会出现掉帧。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"requestanimationframe\">requestAnimationFrame</h2><p><code>requestAnimationFrame</code>（rAF）在浏览器下一次重绘前执行回调，是实现流畅动画的最佳选择。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function animate(element: HTMLElement): void {&#10;  let start: number | null = null;&#10;  const duration = 1000;&#10;  const distance = 300;&#10;&#10;  function step(timestamp: number): void {&#10;    if (!start) start = timestamp;&#10;    const progress = Math.min((timestamp - start) / duration, 1);&#10;    const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 3);&#10;&#10;    element.style.transform = `translateX(${eased * distance}px)`;&#10;&#10;    if (progress &lt; 1) {&#10;      requestAnimationFrame(step);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  requestAnimationFrame(step);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 